  aciklama:
  - "Telvelerinin son k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131ndaki k\u0131vr\u0131ml\u0131 baz\u0131
    b\xF6l\xFCmler, \xFCzerinde demlik olan bir \xE7aydanl\u0131\u011F\u0131 and\u0131r\u0131yor.
    \u2615 \xC7evreye yay\u0131lan buhar, bir bilinmezli\u011Fin geride b\u0131rak\u0131laca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    i\u015Faret ederken, \xE7aydanl\u0131\u011F\u0131n kendisi ise araftaki g\xF6n\xFCl
    i\u015Finin yak\u0131n zamanda netle\u015Fece\u011Fine, g\xF6n\xFCllerin demlenece\u011Fine,
    demin ve suyun birbirine kar\u0131\u015Farak uyum i\xE7inde olaca\u011F\u0131na
    yorulur. Seni, ho\u015Fland\u0131\u011F\u0131n ki\u015Fiyle ilgili \xE7ok g\xFCzel
    geli\u015Fmelerin bekledi\u011Fini bilmeni isterim {{isim}}. Sana dair \"belirsizlik
    i\xE7eren\" hisleri, pek yak\u0131nda g\xF6z\xFCn\xFCn g\xF6rebilece\u011Fi ho\u015F
    bir hal alacak. Kaynama noktas\u0131na \xE7ok yak\u0131ns\u0131n\u0131z..."
